      "content": "small steps dont really change anything though. thats what they want u to think so u keep moving the boxes. everything feels so rigged, like no matter how much i try to \"pivot\" or \"explore interests\" i'm still just stuck in this same heavy, grey existence. it feels like there's no actual way out of the system, you know? like the loop is the only reality.\n volare no way to actually win. feels more like just",
